  "bodyHash": "58d40a1da4bd6369",
  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fmWwWkZ.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"240\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/askYVd2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Available%20for%20Minecraft-1.19%20%7C%201.18%20%7C%201.17%20%7C%201.16-ecebe6?labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"386\" height=\"28\" />&emsp;<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Install%20on-Client%20Only-ecebe6?labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"210\" height=\"28\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stylish-effects/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=2020709689%3A7498\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3yrSsw7\" width=\"320\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3jr9xQw\" width=\"215\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stylish-effects/files/all?filter-status=1&amp;filter-game-version=2020709689%3A7499\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3nRXr4m\" width=\"325\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/30lZmFY\" width=\"208\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/puzzles-lib\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3jr9xQw\" width=\"215\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forge-config-api-port-fabric\"><img src=\"https://bit.ly/3clkhvn\" width=\"299\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/askYVd2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong>📖 简介：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>Stylish Effects</strong> 彻底重构了状态效果的显示方式。提供多种模式供您选择，并拥有无数配置选项，助您打造梦寐以求的效果展示界面。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/askYVd2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong>📚 内容：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">首先，那个简陋的原版 HUD 效果显示已被更华丽的版本取代，新版本包含效果持续时间以及当前的效果等级。这个显示界面现在也用于物品栏中，因为它更加紧凑，可以在效果开始重叠之前显示更多的效果。而且这个新的物品栏显示不再局限于玩家背包，现在您可以在每一个容器中看到您的活跃效果！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">但是等等，既然状态效果以小巧紧凑的图标形式显示，您如何知道当前活跃效果的名称呢？别担心，为此添加了一个方便的提示框（Tooltip）。当安装了 <span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-enough-effect-descriptions-jeed\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>Just Enough Effect Descriptions (JEED)</strong></span></a> by <span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/mehvahdjukaar\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>MehVahdJukaar</strong></span></a> 时，提示框将变得更加实用。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">您喜欢原版的物品栏状态效果显示，并希望保留它，甚至也想在 HUD 上使用它吗？没问题！您可以选择任何想要的控件模式，或者干脆不使用。此外，还有许多可配置的设置，例如效果显示的屏幕侧边、行数和列数、自定义透明度、文本颜色、自定义屏幕位置等，设置项繁多。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/askYVd2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong>📷 截图：</strong></span></p>\n<table style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/480/288/2022-07-23_22.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/480/290/2022-07-23_22.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Stylish Effects 正在展示其时尚的效果</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>可以选择和配置各种效果渲染类型</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/480/291/2022-07-23_22.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/480/292/2022-07-23_22.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>紧凑的效果显示替代了原版物品栏中的显示</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>效果显示不仅限于物品栏，还显示在所有容器中</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/480/293/2022-07-23_22.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/480/294/2022-07-23_22.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>悬停在效果控件上时会显示有用的提示</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><strong>如此多的可选设置，打造您专属的效果显示</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/480/295/2022-07-23_22.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"231\" /></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>优秀的 JEI 和 REI 兼容性</strong></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/askYVd2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong>💡 常见问题解答：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>问：如何在 Forge 上配置此模组？</strong><br /><strong>答：</strong>安装我的 <span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>Config Menus for Forge</strong></span></a> 模组，即可直接在游戏内配置！</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>问：如何在 Fabric 上配置此模组？</strong><br /><strong>答：</strong>目前尚未实现在游戏内直接编辑配置文件的功能。相反，当您在世界中时，运行 <code>/config showfile &lt;modid&gt;</code> 命令，选择 <code>CLIENT</code> 或 <code>SERVER</code>（取决于模组），然后点击聊天栏中出现的文件名（以 .toml 结尾），以便在单独的编辑器中手动编辑配置文件。保存文件后，配置文件将在几秒后在游戏内自动重新加载，因此无需重启游戏。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>问：我可以在 Minecraft 1.19 之前的版本上哪里下载 Fabric 版的此模组？</strong><br /><strong>答：</strong>旧版本的下载请前往 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stylish-effects-fabric\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>旧项目页面</strong></span></a>。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/askYVd2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><strong>🏆 鸣谢：</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Stylish Effects 的开发得到了以下模组的启发和帮助：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/deadzoke\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>Deadzoke</strong></span></a>，其 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ignitehud\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Ignite HUD</span></a> 模组启发了效果持续时间显示功能</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/dmitrylovin\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>Dmitrylovin</strong></span></a>，其 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/inventory-hud-forge\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Inventory HUD+</span></a> 模组启发了紧凑的效果等级显示功能</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/snownee_\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><strong>Snownee</strong></span></a>，其 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mini-effects\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Mini Effects</span></a> 模组提供了一个禁用默认 JEI 物品栏状态效果处理的小技巧</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/askYVd2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/lunapixelstudios/projects\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=CurseForge&amp;message=LunaPixelStudios&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"282\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/LunaPixelStudio\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitter/follow/LunaPixelStudio?label=Twitter&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=twitter&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"149\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://discord.gg/8ZmhaPPbjE\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Discord&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"220\" height=\"28\" /></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/1MOyd2u.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"300\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 36px;\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/fuzs_/projects\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Fuzs_&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"97\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Fuzss\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Fuzss&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=github&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"97\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC2l26SuCmCNSCPefpfbCX7Q\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Fuzs&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=youtube&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"89\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=@Fusseel&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=twitter&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"124\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/user/Fusseel\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=u/Fusseel&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=reddit&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Reddit\" width=\"130\" height=\"28\" /></a>&emsp;<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&amp;message=Fuzs%200212&amp;color=ecebe6&amp;labelColor=2F4858&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"127\" height=\"28\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/askYVd2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>\n<table style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/config-menus-forge\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/kiHP8s9.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/better-animations-collection\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OVV5lXk.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/trading-post\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/UzgNFIB.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/pick-up-notifier\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DCwxKZU.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/console-experience\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/aXWOS7B.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/easy-magic\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Mlxi8cy.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/visual-workbench\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DTzDrbm.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/diagonal-fences\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/mU9OlhP.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/golden-age-combat\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sHiR309.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n<td>&emsp;&emsp;</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/air-hop\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/MinxlVJ.png\" width=\"410\" height=\"115\" /></a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&nbsp;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/askYVd2.png\" width=\"854\" height=\"14\" /></p>",
